# PFE - Microsoft 365 Security Audit Platform

## Overview

This project was developed as part of a Final Year Project (PFE) at CloudShift.

The solution automatically audits multiple Microsoft 365 environments in a multi-tenant context in order to detect security risks related to privileged accounts, authentication mechanisms, and access governance.

The platform relies on Microsoft Graph API, Microsoft Entra ID, and a serverless architecture based on Azure Functions.

---

# Main Features

* Microsoft Entra ID administrative role auditing
* Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) verification
* Conditional Access policy analysis
* Privileged Identity Management (PIM) configuration auditing
* Detection of inactive administrator accounts
* Risk scoring and classification system
* JSON audit report generation
* Audit history tracking
* Multi-tenant support
* Azure Functions automation
* Microsoft Teams notifications
* Streamlit interface for result visualization

---

